UploadOrCreateAFileInSlackResponse.description:
Response schema for Slack file upload operations.

Supports both files.upload (deprecated, sunset 2025-11-12) and files.completeUploadExternal (recommended).
- files.upload returns: {ok, file, error}
- files.completeUploadExternal returns: {ok, files, error, response_metadata}
